  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>The Ostland Marcher is one of the oldest breeds of destrier in the Empire, and originates from the northern borderlands between the Empire and Kislev. An extraordinarily hardy beast, it's a far smaller warhorse than many of its contemporaries, but still packs an enormous punch. Their heads are heavy with a wide face and convex profile, and they have an incredibly heavy confirmation that is broad, muscular, and surprisingly compact. Their coats are usually roan or gray, although blacks are not unknown. Most Ostland Marchers stand near 16 hands tall.</p>"
